    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Join Percy the caterpillar to practice skills involved with time. This fun title designed for Key Stage 1 uses interesting activities, combined with a child-friendly interface to teach and test the topic. With printable worksheets and fully narrated text, this title is also great for unsupervised use. Featuring both analogue and digital clocks, the activities involve reading the time, setting a clock to a given time, placing events in the correct time order, working out time differences and solving a fun quiz.</marc:subfield>
